## VPS setup

1. Install Docker Engine and Docker Compose plugin.
2. Copy ops/vps contents to /opt/__INIT_APP_NAME__.
3. Copy app.env.example to app.env and fill pull-only ACR credentials locally.
4. Install either the generated systemd service/timer or cron example.
5. Run deploy-image.sh once manually and verify the health endpoint.

The VPS pulls the mutable environment channel tag while CI also preserves immutable SHA tags. Do not use latest as a deployment channel.
